<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Class <link linkend="_class_action_debug_mariadb">ActionDebugMariadb</link></para>

<para>This class handles debugging actions for MariaDB within the <link linkend="_namespace_bearsampp">Bearsampp</link> application. It processes command-line arguments to determine the type of debugging action to perform, retrieves the corresponding output from MariaDB, and displays it using the appropriate method. </para>
